# PRAXIS R2 — UI Implementation Plan

## Background
This plan addresses a comprehensive UI/UX overhaul for the Accenture Innovation Challenge 2026 Round 2 prototype.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is **not** a redesign of the underlying C1–C5 architecture. All backend logic, PipelineResult contracts, persona logic, memory gateway, and scenario definitions are preserved exactly. Only the presentation layer (C6) is being improved.

