## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q1: Persona naming.** The spec says "Business Leader" / "Analyst". The current backend has `zone_business_head` / `dark_store_ops_manager`. These map to different entitlements and data scope. Should the display rename match exactly as "Business Leader" / "Analyst" or use "Business Leader" / "Operations Manager" (which better reflects the actual entitlement boundary)?

> [!NOTE]
> **Q2: Persona-differentiated Tab 2 depth.** Should Business Leader see only the top driver with a plain summary, while Analyst sees all drivers + drill-down? This is zero backend work — just a conditional render block.

> [!NOTE]
> **Q3: Home "Decisions in Motion".** The spec calls for a section showing active investigations on the Home page. Approve adding a compact block beneath the priority banner?

